# 🧊 Frozen Giant Showdown

## 📌 Why This File Exists

Frozen Giant Showdown is the **original gameplay concept created before GIANTBOUND**.

GIANTBOUND is growing from this foundation. Its mechanics are being collected here so they can be reused, improved, combined, or redesigned instead of being lost.

Most importantly, the original concept is planned to become the foundation of **GIANTBOUND Classic Mode**. The source should be treated as a complete gameplay concept, not merely as a list of disconnected old mechanics.

## 🎄 Original Concept

A multiplayer Christmas mini-game where one player becomes a Giant Frozen Yeti and the remaining players become Survivors. Survivors complete Frozen Parkour, reach cannons, and shoot the Yeti before time runs out.

## 👥 Players

- 2–10 players
- 1 Giant Frozen Yeti
- Remaining players are Survivors

## 🗿 Giant Frozen Yeti

- ❤️ 1000 HP
- 🚫 Could not directly eliminate players
- 🪤 Could create obstacles and make parkour harder

## 🎯 Original Survivor Objective

Survivors completed Frozen Parkour, reached the Cannon Area, entered a cannon, and shot the Yeti.

- 💥 Each cannon hit = 25 damage
- 🎯 40 hits were required to reach 0 HP

These numbers are source mechanics for Classic Mode and are not universal GIANTBOUND numbers.

## 🔄 Respawn

Falling into the ice did not eliminate a player. The player respawned at the start after 2 seconds.

